{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Stadtrundfahrt 是一款專為城市旅遊設計的行程規劃工具，由柏林熊 Bruno 擔任你的導遊。輸入住宿地點與旅遊天數，它便會為你規劃一條可行的步行路線，並以互動地圖呈現。目前正在限時免費，原價 US $0.99，適合喜愛自由行、想輕鬆安排行程的旅客。</p>\n\n<h2>智能規劃步行路線</h2>\n<p>Stadtrundfahrt 運用 Apple Intelligence，直接在裝置上規劃行程，無需註冊或登入，保護你的私隱。提供彩色路線與印章標記，你可透過拖曳方式調整停留點，或要求 Bruno 提供驚喜選項。行程規劃完成後可離線使用，全程無廣告、無追蹤，絕對安心。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-336-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-337-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-338-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-339-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-340-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-341-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Stadtrundfahrt</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T09:35:54.016561+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}